  "notes": "NaN (D-046): frictional_strength holds default quiet NaNs of invalid operations in 633 of 1800 values, from step 96. Cause (UD-039, TN-11): upstream's explicit-Euler ageing update theta <- theta (1 - V dt/d_c) + dt is unstable when V dt/d_c > 1 (d_c = 5e-7 here); the state of sliding nodes turns negative below -phi_star, ln(1 + theta/phi_star) of the regularized Dieterich coefficient is NaN, and those nodes then count as sticking. Reproduced in upstream-compat mode; the port's corrected default stops at step 96 with the UD-039 domain error (negative state)."
}
